<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-809] Wrong metric on LedgerDeleteOp and LedgerOpenOp</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-809</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;These two operations uses startTime as the latency for metric, which is wrong. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;    void openComplete(&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; rc, LedgerHandle lh) {
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (BKException.Code.OK != rc) {
            openOpLogger.registerFailedEvent(startTime);
        } &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;else&lt;/span&gt; {
            openOpLogger.registerSuccessfulEvent(startTime);
        }
        cb.openComplete(rc, lh, ctx);
    }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
